prompt.zh-CN:
改用 AtomicInteger stock，初值为 1。两个线程各执行一次：
if (stock.get() > 0) { stock.decrementAndGet(); 发货(); }
无其他修改。是否可能发出两件商品？给出交错过程，再提出一个保证“库存不为负且最多发货一次”的修复。假设发货本身不会失败。

prompt.en:
Now use an AtomicInteger stock initialized to 1. Two threads each execute:
if (stock.get() > 0) { stock.decrementAndGet(); ship(); }
There are no other changes. Could two items ship? Show the interleaving, then propose a fix that keeps stock nonnegative and ships at most once. Assume shipping cannot fail.
